    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You don’t just see walls. You see what they remember.”</em></p><p>Your mind thinks like a load-bearing structure: you notice stress, fault-lines, and the way pressure travels through stone, metal, and people.</p><ul><li>You gain a small bonus to Perception and Insight checks, and your passive Perception and passive Insight improve.</li><li>You are especially good at spotting structural weakness, traps, and bad reinforcement.</li><li>In Bad Eden strategic play, your presence nudges Stabilize Landform and Patch-the-Breach type actions toward cheaper, smarter outcomes (handled via flags).</li></ul>",
